        "FleetDesc": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Ui.ST_Ui",
          "Key": "UI_Race_Fleet_999_Quest_01_Desc",
          "SourceString": "异象「别让我停下！」，在坊间有着「午夜的海特洛幽灵车神」之称。它总是独自在夜晚的盘山公路驰骋，向过往车辆发起挑战，仿佛在渴求着能够真正与它一较高下的对手。",
          "LocalizedString": "The Anomaly \"Don't Let Me Stop!\" is known among locals as \"The Midnight Ghost Racer of Hethereau.\" It always races alone on winding mountain roads at night, challenging passing vehicles as if yearning for an opponent who can truly match its skill."
        },
        "FleetRaceTrackIcon": {
