        },
        "FleetDesc": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_Ui.ST_Ui",
          "Key": "UI_Race_Fleet_999_01_Desc",
          "SourceString": "战胜异象「别让我停下！」后，它心满意足地泯除了。现在，每当看到它遗留的残像，总会回想起那时与它并驾齐驱的热情。在记忆深处，「午夜的幽灵车神」似乎仍徘徊在赛道上，等待着命中注定的挑战者。",
          "LocalizedString": "After defeating the Anomaly \"Don't Let Me Stop!\", it was satisfied and underwent nullification. Now, whenever I see the remnants it left behind, I'm reminded of the passion we shared racing side by side back then. Deep in my memory, \"The Midnight Ghost Racer\" still seems to linger on the track, waiting for its destined challenger."
        },
