          "Key": "UI_Race_Fleet_02_01_Desc",
          "SourceString": "队长艾丽于大学时期组建的车队。如今成员们都已是上班族，但这个车队保留至今，姐妹们时常通过赛车联络感情，她们将赛车视为生活的一部分，不在意输赢。",
          "LocalizedString": "A racing team formed by Captain Elle during her college years, who have all grown up to be office workers. The team was kept to this day as a social circle. The sisters regularly stay connected through racing, seeing it as part of their lives rather than caring about winning or losing."
